WEBVTT

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:04.090
Howard saved us

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.290
Sharla!

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.660
Sharla! Howard!

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:19.460
Howard, hold on!

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:28.340
Howard...

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.940
It's okay. Up we go.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.460
Howard, get away by yourself.

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.790
No way! We're going home to the colony together!

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:39.780
Howard...

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.120
Howard! Sharla!

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:47.540
We're coming now!

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.190
We're going home.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.180
Howard! Sharla!

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:37.680
Sharla... Howard...

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.240
Sharla! Howard!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.040
Shingo, stop!

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.680
Let go! Let go of me!

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.030
Calm down, Shingo.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.380
But at this rate...

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:57.110
They're already done for.

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:59.530
Whatever, just let go! I said let go!

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:00.590
Shingo!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.270
Menori, move!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.960
Don't you get it? We can't afford to lose you too!

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.270
Sorry, Sharla...

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.460
If I hadn't said we should go to the mainland...

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.290
Stop it, Luna.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:48.260
It's not your fault.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.140
He's right. It's nobody's fault.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:52.040
But...

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.240
It's my fault.

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:57.440
If I'd made the ship better...

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.460
...if the Gravity Control Unit hadn't stopped...

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.010
...this wouldn't have happened!

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:06.560
Shingo...

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:13.190
Let's go.

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:16.310
Do you plan to stay here forever?

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:17.690
We have no more water.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.030
If we don't hurry and get past the desert, we'll all die.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:22.380
But...

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.210
Let's go.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.330
We should go too.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:32.540
Got that right.

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:41.660
Shingo.

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:46.270
C'mon, let's go. Grab on.

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.460
I'm overheatin'.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:51.480
His mirror...

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:02.210
Shingo.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.310
I'm fine. All of you, go on ahead.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.580
What are you saying?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.760
Hey, everyone, take a look!

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:24.110
It's a forest!

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:38.880
In any event, this fruit's pretty good.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.890
Haven't I tasted somethin' with this flavour before?

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:47.920
That's right! It's the same taste as that first monster plant we ate when we got here!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:51.290
If I remember correctly, Luna and Sharla...

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.920
Well anyways, we've crossed the desert.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:03.180
All that's left is to head for the main computer!

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:05.390
But we can't let our guard down!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.990
Somethin' like the giant lizard might show up!

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:12.740
But if that happens, Howard's Papa attack...

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:15.780
...I mean, we'll evade it somehow're...

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:16.830
Chako...

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.570
You don't have to force it.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.560
Shingo, make sure you eat.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.430
You need your strength.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:38.320
You can sure eat at a time like this.

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:41.920
Howard and Sharla are dead!

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:43.830
They won't come back!

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:45.480
What about it?

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:48.180
The dead are beyond our help.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.140
Right now, we should think about living.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:56.130
Lament all you like, but it won't bring them back to life.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:57.330
Menori...

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:58.870
I only spoke the truth.

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:01.940
How dare you say that!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:06.560
Out of all your friends who you've lived with until now, as long as you survive it's fine?

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:09.170
No matter what happens to your friends, as long as you survive?

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:12.520
Why don't you say something?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.870
You're heartless!

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:17.920
Shingo!

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:18.590
Luna...

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.190
I'll go.

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:28.010
Menori...

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:34.910
It may have been too soon to speak to Shingo so harshly.

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.490
I'll be right back.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:54.110
Menori...

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:58.160
Menori?

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:04.190
It may have been a harsh way to say it...

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.040
...but Shingo is losing the will to live.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:11.990
Even if there weren't a computer on this planet that hates people...

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:14.240
...once you give up in your heart, it's over.

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:15.370
Menori...

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:19.640
I never thought Menori was that kind of person!

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:21.590
Shingo...

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:23.580
But I'm right, aren't I?

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:26.210
What have we been working so hard for all this time?

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.840
If we don't all go home together, it's all been meaningless!

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:33.180
Sacrificing Sharla and Howard and going home ourselves...

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.360
That's just what living is!

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:39.480
No matter what happens, keep living!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:43.460
That's all we can do for Howard and Sharla!

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:46.270
You might be right...

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.580
...but I can't accept it that easily!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:54.360
If only I'd made the Orion better...

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:56.770
Damn it...

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:07.790
Help me!

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:10.080
Huh?

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:15.440
Hey, if you tell everyone about this I'll deny it!

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:21.410
I'll explain to everyone!

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:23.990
How hard you've been trying up until now, Bell.

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:26.430
So stop already.

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:28.230
You've done enough.

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:32.960
When you show them these, everyone will agree.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.570
Nobody will hold it against you.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.690
Eat right down to the core so nobody finds out.

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.270
Then there's no evidence.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.420
I miss you!

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:56.540
There's always a blue sky in your heart.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:08.320
Luna!

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:11.730
I'll do my best! I'll try hard, without giving up!

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:17.540
Sharla...

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.610
I won't give up either.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:23.660
No matter what happens, it's for Howard and Sharla too.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.130
What is this place?

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:19.510
Whatever it is, it's terrible... it's all messed up.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:24.290
It might have been the effect of the tectonic changes the computer talked about.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.510
Mom... Dad...

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:28.340
Chako...

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:29.690
Wait a sec.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:36.930
No doubt about it.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:40.230
The main computer's just past this town.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:43.120
And if we go there, there'll be a space ship, right?

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:47.170
And we might find out about Adam's parents.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:49.760
Let's go.

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:51.090
Look out!

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:54.860
That thing from before's shown up again!

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:58.510
It's trying to keep us from getting close to the main computer.

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:00.260
There's another over there!

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:01.610
Behind us too!

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.820
Three at once? We don't have a chance!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:07.680
What should we do?

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:08.680
Run for it!

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:49.790
What should we do? They're sure to find us eventually.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.530
I'll act as a decoy.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.810
I'll lure them away, and in the meantime...

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.190
Don't be ridiculous!

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.320
We can't leave you behind by yourself, Luna.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.920
But otherwise they'll wipe us out!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:04.040
I'll go too.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.170
Kaoru...

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:06.820
We'll meet up over there.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:10.490
Y-yeah, but...

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:11.360
Very well.

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:14.360
Leave everyone to me.

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:15.820
Please.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.030
Don't die.

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:25.980
Let's go.

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:45.330
Okay, we're going too.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:46.460
Luna...

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:48.030
You'd better not die!

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:49.870
Hurry.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.380
Shingo?

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.970
I'll bring him. Go on ahead.

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:56.390
Anyways, hurry!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:57.890
Shingo, let's go!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.020
Get your head together!

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:07.760
At this rate, they'll catch up to us.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.220
I know.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:10.550
I have an idea.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.320
I guess we tricked them.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:42.820
Let's go.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.410
I hope Luna and Kaoru are okay.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.560
Of course! They're definitely okay!

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:02.060
Stop!

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:04.490
What's wrong?

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:05.240
It's them.

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:06.400
What'd you say?

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:10.910
This is bad.

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:12.890
It's just a direct path behind us.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.360
There's nowhere we can hide.

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:18.180
What do we do? At this rate we'll be found out!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.090
I hope Luna and Kaoru are okay.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.830
I'll lure them away.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:23.540
Let's go.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:31.230
Shingo!

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:33.930
Idiot! What are you doing?

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.770
Let go! Let go of me!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.090
I don't care what happens to me!

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:45.260
Bell! Take care of those two!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.230
Come on, Shingo!

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:49.870
Menori...

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:01.080
Damn it!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:03.030
Another dead end here.

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:22.610
Looks like it's gone.

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:24.410
Let's go, Shingo.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.180
Why did you save me?

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.040
What?

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.070
Leave me alone!

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:33.370
I couldn't be the only one to go home.

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:37.570
It's my fault Howard and Sharla died.

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.560
So I should also...

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:50.660
Give me a break.

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.940
What would you dying accomplish?

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:56.890
Do you think Howard or Sharla would be happy about it?

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:07.160
Menori and Shingo are?

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:10.160
Shingo was actin' super reckless.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:12.440
Sorry. Even though I was there..

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.920
I'm sure they're okay, since Menori's there.

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:27.560
It might be back soon. Let's go, Shingo.

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.570
Damn it! It cut us off at the pass!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.030
Run for it, Shingo!

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:48.480
As long as you survive, it's fine?

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:51.780
No matter what happens to your friends, as long as you survive?

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:05.390
Menori!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:06.750
Shingo!

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:26.990
What happened?

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.010
That way!

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.090
Menori...

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:43.720
Are you okay, Menori?

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:46.010
I'm fine. It just grazed me.

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:47.580
But...

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:49.790
Thank you.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:55.080
Thanks to you I'm alive, Shingo.

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:56.840
Menori...

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:00.970
Menori, I...

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:03.890
Menori! Shingo!

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:06.710
What a relief. You're okay.

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:08.240
Menori! Shingo!

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.020
This is...

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:16.120
Just what happened here?

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:18.370
Howard...

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:21.290
Howard saved us.

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:22.680
Howard did?

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:24.070
What do you mean?

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:27.630
If we didn't have this, it probably would have killed us.

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:32.510
It really makes you think... after all that's happened, for him to save you like this...

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:38.660
Everyone, let's keep it up.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.020
No matter what happens, we'll survive.

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:50.320
Right. If we head this way, we'll reach the main computer.

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:53.620
We don't know when the other two'll show up.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:54.630
We should leave now.

00:22:10.310 --> 00:22:14.020
Howard... Sharla... I won't give up.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:16.190
I'll never give up!

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:34.790
What is this?

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:38.620
No doubt about it.

00:22:39.030 --> 00:22:41.200
This is where the main computer is.

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:49.760
Then...

00:22:50.730 --> 00:22:51.970
In here...

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:06.930
The main computer, Survive, is somewhere in this building, right?

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:08.840
Everyone, be careful!

00:23:09.260 --> 00:23:11.540
The drones've come out again!

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:14.170
There's a weird guy over here.

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:15.220
Wait!

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:18.110
It seems like it's calling for us.

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:21.180
You think so? It gives me the creeps.

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:24.780
And where's it tryin' to take us?

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:28.010
Next time: Mom! Dad!
